A compact pill for tags, attributes, filters and removable tokens.
[Appica docs](https://appica.dev/ui/components/react/chip)

<%= embed UI::ChipPreview, :default %>

## Usage

```ruby
Chip { "Design" }
Chip(variant: :outline, dismissible: true, close_label: "Remove React") { "React" }
Chip(href: tag_path(tag)) { "##{tag.name}" }
```

A `<button>` (an `<a>` with `href:`) in [Button](<%= page_path(:button) %>)'s palette with compact sizes.
`dismissible: true` adds a ✕: clicking the chip plays a blur-and-scale exit, removes it and emits
`ui--chip:dismiss` - cancel that event to handle removal yourself (e.g. a Turbo Stream `remove`).

