## API reference

### Chip

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `variant:` | `:soft`, `:outline`, `:primary`, `:secondary`, `:destructive` | `:soft` | Style (or the group's). |
| `size:` | `:sm`, `:md`, `:lg` | `:md` | Height, padding, text and icon (or the group's). |
| `dismissible:` | `Boolean` | `false` | Adds a ✕ and dismisses on click. |
| `close_label:` | `String` | "Dismiss" | The dismiss action's screen-reader text (translated). |
| `disabled:` | `Boolean` | `false` | Disables it. |
| `href:` | `String` | - | Render an `<a>`. |

Event: `ui--chip:dismiss` (cancelable).

### ChipGroup

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `variant:` / `size:` | as Chip | - | Defaults for the chips inside. |

Dispatch `ui--chip-group:clear` on it to dismiss every dismissible chip.

## Accessibility

- A native button or link: focusable, activated with Enter / Space.
- For a dismissible chip the whole chip is the dismiss control - make `close_label:` specific ("Remove React").
- For selectable chips set `aria_pressed:`.
- The exit animation becomes a plain fade under `prefers-reduced-motion`.
